---
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/legal-layout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  canonicalPath="/refund-policy"
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Refund and cancellation policy for Docita subscriptions and paid add-ons"
  lastUpdated="March 09, 2026"
>
  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">1. Scope</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      This Refund Policy applies to paid Docita subscriptions and paid add-ons
      purchased directly from Docita.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">2. Subscription Start</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Subscriptions begin when the selected plan is activated and applicable
      payment is confirmed.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">3. Monthly Plans</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Monthly subscriptions are billed in advance and are generally
      non-refundable after billing, except where required by law.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">4. Annual Plans</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Annual subscriptions are billed in advance. You may request a refund
      within 14 days of the first annual charge if your account has not
      exceeded normal onboarding and evaluation usage.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">5. Add-ons and Usage Charges</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Usage-based charges (for example messaging or AI credits already consumed)
      are non-refundable. Unused prepaid add-on balances may be reviewed on a
      case-by-case basis.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">6. How to Request a Refund</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Send your request to
      <a class="mx-1 text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:billing@docita.work">billing@docita.work</a>
      with your facility name, registered email, invoice reference, and reason for
      the request. Refund decisions are typically completed within 7 business days.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
